  "id": "assessment-center",
  "term": "assessment center",
  "definition": "An assessment center is a personnel selection setting or procedure in which candidates are evaluated in person, including through cognitive testing and observation of their behavior. In this context, it is used to make selection decisions and raises concerns about fairness when testing conditions are altered.",
